        "html": "<div class=\"progression-page\" data-progression-page=\"profile\" data-companion-context=\"guest-profile\" data-companion-copy=\"This is a guest-local website profile, not a connected identity.\">\n  <nav class=\"detail-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Guest profile</span></nav>\n  <header class=\"progression-hero\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">TOADAL FEAST &middot; GUEST JOURNEY</p><p class=\"progression-eyebrow\">LOCAL PROFILE</p><h1>Your guest profile</h1><p class=\"progression-lede\">A browser-local view of website progress and completed browser preview scores. This is not a connected identity; there is no sign-in or cross-device sync.</p><p class=\"progression-truth-note\">No biography, account history, public rank, canonical achievement history, or game/mobile save data is read or implied.</p></header>\n  <section class=\"progression-section\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-status-title\"><div class=\"progression-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">GUEST STATUS</p><h2 id=\"profile-status-title\">Progress snapshot</h2></div><span class=\"progression-local-badge\">Not connected</span></div><dl class=\"progression-stat-grid\"><div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>Level</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"level\" aria-live=\"polite\">&mdash;</dd></div><div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>Total XP</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"xp\" aria-live=\"polite\">&mdash;</dd></div><div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>XP to next level</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"xp-to-next\" aria-live=\"polite\">&mdash;</dd></div><div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>Sparks</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"sparks\" aria-live=\"polite\">&mdash;</dd></div><div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>Home Treats</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"treats\" aria-live=\"polite\">&mdash;</dd></div><div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>Daily streak</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"streak\" aria-live=\"polite\">&mdash;</dd></div><div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>Page discoveries</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"discoveries\" aria-live=\"polite\">&mdash;</dd></div><div class=\"progression-stat\"><dt>Quests complete</dt><dd data-progression-stat=\"quests-complete\" aria-live=\"polite\">&mdash;</dd></div></dl><p class=\"progression-storage\" data-progression-storage-status role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Guest progress is stored only in this browser.</p></section>\n  <section class=\"progression-section\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-scores-title\"><div class=\"progression-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">WEBSITE PLAYER</p><h2 id=\"profile-scores-title\">Personal bests &amp; recent scores</h2></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/leaderboards/\">Open Leaderboards <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a></div><div class=\"progression-empty\" data-profile-local-score-list data-progression-empty=\"No completed local scores yet. Play the Wicked Bites browser preview to record a personal best.\"><p>No global or public score table is connected.</p></div><p><a class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" href=\"/play/\">Browse browser games</a></p></section>\n  <section class=\"progression-section\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-badges-title\"><div class=\"progression-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">LOCAL RECOGNITION</p><h2 id=\"profile-badges-title\">Earned markers</h2></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/feast-pass/rewards/\">View rewards <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a></div><div class=\"progression-empty\" data-profile-badge-list data-progression-empty=\"No local badges have been earned yet.\"><p>Markers are derived from real local activity and have no entitlement value.</p></div></section>\n  <section class=\"progression-section\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-collection-title\"><div class=\"progression-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">DISCOVERY</p><h2 id=\"profile-collection-title\">Pages &amp; Treats</h2></div></div><div class=\"progression-empty\" data-progression-discovery-list data-progression-empty=\"No World or Stories page visits recorded.\"><p>Page visits do not indicate canonical world, character, or story completion.</p></div><div class=\"progression-empty\" data-progression-treat-list data-progression-empty=\"No approved Home Treats have been collected.\"><p>Home candy finds are saved as browser-local collectibles.</p></div></section>\n  <nav class=\"progression-nav\" aria-label=\"Player pages\"><a href=\"/feast-pass/\">Feast Pass</a><a href=\"/feast-pass/quests/\">Quests</a><a href=\"/feast-pass/rewards/\">Rewards</a><a href=\"/leaderboards/\">Leaderboards</a><a href=\"/profile/\" aria-current=\"page\">Guest profile <span class=\"sr-only\">(current page)</span></a></nav>\n  <section class=\"progression-controls\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-controls-title\"><div><h2 id=\"profile-controls-title\">Local data controls</h2><p>Clearing removes website progression only. It leaves unrelated game, cartridge, and mobile data untouched.</p></div><button class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" type=\"button\" data-clear-progression>Clear website progression</button></section>\n</div>"
